{title: Yeh Din Kya Aaye}
{artist: Mukesh Salil Chowdhury Choti Si Baat}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Ye din kya aye,        [A#]lage phool [D#]hansane
Dekho [G#]basanti [A#]basanti,        hone [D#]lage mere [A#]sapane
[D#]Sone jaisi [A#]ho rahi hai,        [D#]har subah [A#]meri
[D#]Lage har [A#]saanjh ab,        [D#]gulaal se [A#]bhari
[G#]Chalane lagi [Fm]mahaki hui,        [G#]pawan magan [D#]jhum ke
[D#]Anchal tera [A#]chum ke,        [D#]Wahaan man [A#]baawara
[D#]aaj ud [A#]chala,        [D#]Jahaan par [A#]hai gagan
[D#]salona saan [A#]wala,        [G#]Ja ke wahi [Fm]rakh de kahi
[G#]man rangon men [D#]khol ke,        [D#]Sapane ye [A#]anamol se
